abstract: "Example forward solutions with the full source space (the fsaverage template and four CamCAN participants) for CaliBrain, a Python toolbox for uncertainty quantification, calibration, and benchmarking in Bayesian M/EEG inverse source imaging. CaliBrain reduces them to 1284 sources and creates the leadfield files from them."
keywords:
  - EEG
  - MEG
  - forward model
  - leadfield
  - fsaverage
  - CamCAN
